#slide[#box(position={x=pt(25),y=pt(20),width=pt(670),height=pt(490)})[#chart(kind="pie",title="Labels",data={categories={"One","Two","Three"},series={{name="Value",values={10,20,30}}}},legend={position="right"},data_labels={value=true,category=true,series=true,percentage=true,position="bestFit"})]]
